## Facebook Pixel (we can also use this following env for pixel id if no pixel id provided in ecomerse setting it will be used)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FACEBOOK_PIXEL_ID=FB_PIXEL_ID

## Google Tag Manager (we can also use this following env for GTM id if no GTM id provided in ecomerse setting it will be used)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=GTM-XXXXX

